Z||000000||yo_sweets_babe||12-02-2001||06:40 PM||||Hey sweetie<BR>People come and go through life...friends, past "loves"...people who are jealous now...<BR>Sure, there are a lot of people out there who don't want to see us together, either for race or jealousy, but we can survive them, and I want you to remember that.  No matter what the situation, how bad, big, or stressful, and however p!ssed off or depressed you feel, I'll always be here for you and with you every step of the way till they back off and we're happy once again.  My dream really did become a reality, u know it, I know it, even my parents know it, and the sun will shine as long as we're together.  Cheer up hun, all will look up in the end.  Love you forever, *~*§teff*~*<P>PS - Anyone who's gonna call me a lil suck, I don't care, cuz I love my guy and he deserves every bit of love i can give him plus more.||||reg||1
